Meryl is the protagonist's first rival; she loves water-type Pokémon.

She is a spontaneous person who often finds herself in a reckless situation because she does not evaluate the possible dangers.

At first glance, she seems like a very friendly and easygoing person, but as water becomes darker the deeper you dive, so does Meryl's truthful personality.

She came to Hessia region to prove to her own family that she is a capable person and to avoid the confrontations about her depression after losing her grandmother.

In the Protagonist and Karl, she finds a friendly figure she can trust and rely on.

She ends up succeeding in joining the lab team and will take part on the Zeta Program alongside the Protagonist in a special team that is responsible to follow leads and search and capture Zeta Pokémon.

What will the future hold for Meryl? Stay tuned to find out!
